    "title": "Permissions instead of text: why a new starting prompt does not secure an AI agent",
    "seoTitle": "Securing AI agents: permissions, not prompts – Venture Labs",
    "seoDescription": "A new starting prompt does not secure an AI agent. Why permissions, tools and approvals beat requests in the prompt, with examples from live operation.",
    "excerpt": "A starting prompt asks, permissions enforce. How AI agents in companies are secured effectively: with folders, tools, keys, locks and approvals.",
    "topicSlug": "ai-automation",
